# device_lifecycle_paused_interrupts: DeviceCore::interrupt raises only while running, and DeviceCore::pause sets the paused state only after draining: pausing with the root FIFO and a child faulted publishes what the drain completes, with interrupts, before the state changes. Resumes (0x1024, 0x1028) while paused then raise nothing; unpause raises its own.
